2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1079) '`weftspun_studio` ran with no request tracing or error reporting at all. A failing deploy, or a slow request, left no trail beyond `flyctl logs`.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1079  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1079) 'Read RFD66606-1073 next for why Tigris replaces `versitygw`.
 # tags: rfd:exit
